Exercise 14 - Validating Missing Values in Remote Work Information

Business Problem:
The HR team received reports that some Data Analyst job postings might not specify
whether the position is remote or on-site. Before investigating the publishing process, 
the data team was asked to verify whether this issue actually exists in the dataset.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SELECT job_work_from_home
FROM job_postings_fact
WHERE job_work_from_home IS NULL;

-- Business Insight:
-- No rows were returned, indicating that there are no missing values in the
-- job_work_from_home column. Therefore, the reported issue could not be
-- confirmed with the available data.
